Viktor 10.10.2026: «Забирай 2512 тоже в Студию»; «Касательно Qwen Image 2.1 лицензии: мы предупреждаем пользователя по этому поводу».

The Models card says after a Qwen painter's fetch that the Artist offers it under Painter (the row itself comes from the lab, the licence in its question). The Artist's note under the painter names the painters not here yet and where they come from (Engine → Models and LoRAs); an fp8 fine-tune is the user's own file and is not named.

Suite: 586/0 in the kitchen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/heresy-artist.js  | 7 +++++--
 tools/console/heresy-weights.js | 1 +
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/heresy-artist.js b/tools/console/heresy-artist.js
index 0c3e92f..7da31b2 100644
--- a/tools/console/heresy-artist.js
+++ b/tools/console/heresy-artist.js
@@ -126,6 +126,8 @@
   function loadPainters() {
     return api("/artist/painters").then(function (d) {
       var sel = $("arPainter"), was = recall(KEY.painter) || sel.value || "krea2-q4", list = (d.painters || []).filter(function (p) { return p.ready; });
+      // HERESY 1323: the painters not here yet (an fp8 fine-tune is the user's own file, not a fetch), said under the choice
+      state.notHere = (d.painters || []).filter(function (p) { return !p.ready && p.key !== "qwen2512-fp8"; }).map(function (p) { return p.label; });
       if (!list.length) return;
       PAINTER_INFO = {};
       list.forEach(function (p) { PAINTERS[p.key] = p.label; PAINTER_INFO[p.key] = p; });
@@ -148,8 +150,9 @@
       }
     }
     if (note) {
-      note.hidden = !p.note;
-      note.textContent = p.note ? tr(p.note) : "";
+      var more = (state.notHere || []).length ? tr("More painters come from Engine → Models and LoRAs:") + " " + state.notHere.join(", ") : "";   // HERESY 1323
+      note.hidden = !p.note && !more;
+      note.textContent = p.note ? tr(p.note) : more;
       note.classList.toggle("is-warn", p.key === "qwen21");
     }
     paintLoras();
diff --git a/tools/console/heresy-weights.js b/tools/console/heresy-weights.js
index f296b8d..df78467 100644
--- a/tools/console/heresy-weights.js
+++ b/tools/console/heresy-weights.js
@@ -181,6 +181,7 @@
   var AFTER = { backbone: "The engine lists it at its next start; Compute then offers it.",
                 listener: "The Trainer's listener hears a set's songs with it; a GGUF one needs llama.cpp built in vendor/llama.cpp (the fetch says how).",
                 artwork: "The Artist paints with it.",
+                qwen: "The Artist offers it under Painter.",   // HERESY 1323
                 trainer: "The Trainer starts from it." };
   function fetchExtra(name) {
     var e = ((S.data && S.data.extras) || []).filter(function (x) { return x.name === name; })[0];
